OL,3,GNEWSANo 10's Christmas tree supplier
OL,4,Aimpacted by drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple whose farm will supply two
OL,7,FChristmas trees to Downing Street said
OL,8,Fthey have replanted thousands of
OL,9,Fsaplings after 4,000 died in the
OL,10,Fsummer's drought.
OL,12,FWill and Ella Miles, who own Welford
OL,13,FChristmas Tree Farm in
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire, said they have
OL,15,Fplanted young trees in the autumn to
OL,16,Fgive them longer to establish their
OL,17,Froots ahead of hot weather.
OL,19,FThe couple said a 6ft (1.8m) Christmas
OL,20,Ftree takes about nine years to grow.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
