OL,3,GNEWSANo 10's Christmas tree supplier
OL,4,Aimpacted by drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of the farm's 12ft (3.6m) Nordmann
OL,7,Ffir trees will be displayed in the
OL,8,Fentrance hall and pillared room in No
OL,9,F10 after the farm was a runner up in a
OL,10,Fcompetition by the British Christmas
OL,11,FTree Growers Association (BCTGA).
